  "notes": "DRAFT for R-G2B-07 (updated after the Manager's calls). Tier 4 (Green) room set for Giant's Steps, in the content/rooms/ format (same legend and tile letters; no new tile types; every room has minBeltTier 4 and floorSet 'giants-steps'). 11 rooms: 7 battle, 1 challenge, 1 treasure, 1 rest, 1 boss. Every room has 'minFloor' (the first floor, 1-5, it may appear on); the Programmer is making the engine change that reads it. Only the Boulder Roller rooms also carry 'maxFloor' 4 (approved by the Manager: the Roller shows on floor 4 only; maxFloor will be added to the Programmer's minFloor item). Green enemies (pebble-pal, cliff-goat, stack-golem, boulder-roller) are mixed with the earlier brute, shield and swarmer (their existing ids); R-G2B-25 also adds the Padded-Staff Bopper (Yellow, id 'bopper') to golem-stairs, shield-shelf, roller-run, switchback-road and giants-gate so the padded staff stays in practice, so the floors do not feel thin and their challenge patterns come along automatically. Floors 1-4 end in the existing Floor Keeper boss; floor 5 ends in the Stone Giant (great-stair). There are NO enemy stats here (stats are Batch 2). Props are art notes only: every prop on a '.' must stay walk-through decoration; solid props are already '#'. 'floors' is the floor-by-floor plan; it is derived from minFloor and maxFloor and the checker keeps them in step. The boss room's chest 'C' is where the light piece and the relic appear after the Stone Giant is freed; faith content is overlay key 'stone-giant' only. Wave sizes are PLACEHOLDERS until balance work. Not built; code is needed to use these.",
